@8439[end]. The ultimate, to which all Divine influx tends.

@10546. To "stretch a tent" (Exodus 33:7) = to provide, dispose, and ordinate the things which are of the Church and of worship.

@HH 429. Stretching obliquely downwards...

@479[5]. Ways tending elsewhere they do not see.

@496[end]. They go in the ways which tend thither.

