@9214. That sensuous things have been laid under -substrata sunt- interior ones. Signified.

@CL 380. Ants which... tread a beaten way.

@TCR 160[2]. I saw in the north a paved way, crowded with Spirits.

@366[2]. Spiritual defilements bestrew -substernunt- the way.

@SE 1063[2]. They rejoice when they see prostrate masses of corpses. @3145[end].

@1260. A bier spread with black cloths.

@1696. He was thrown down on the ground horizontally.

@3117. (The fixed situation of some Spirits is) lying stretched out on the ground.

