@9081. To "strike with the horn -cornuferire-" = to destroy.

@9182[6]. To "strike a covenant." Explained.

@HH 429[end]. When a breath from Heaven struck him... When a breath from Hell struck him.

@432[end]. It is said of an instrument that it strikes, etc.

@AE 316[16]. "The ram pushed" (Daniel 8:4). @--[19].

@--[23]. To "strike (with his horns) the peoples to the ends of the earth" (Deuteronomy 33:17) = to instruct in truths all who are of the Church, and to scatter falsities by means of truths.

Strike.; Impingere.

