@9643. Plenary sustentation by means of truth. Signified, Explained.

@9659. Sustentation in every way by good, and by means of truth from good. Signified, Explained.

@9674. The good of merit... conjoining and supporting. Signified, Explained.

@--. "Pillars" = sustentation. @9689.

