@9747. The goods of truth supporting fully. Signified, Explained.

@9748. Truths from good also supporting fully. Signified.

@9757. The goods and derivative truths also supporting as much as is required for uses. Signified, Explained.

@9768. All the good which supports Heaven. Signified, Explained.

